      "english_2015": " <B0C5><B1B4>!<B0D2><B0D3><B0C5><B0E4><B0E5><B0C0><B0C1><B0A1><B0A2><B0BC><B1BC><B1BD>!<B1BE><B1BF><B1C0><B1C1><B1C2><B1BE><B1C3><B1C4><B1C5>,<B0B8><B0EE><B1BC><B1BD><B1C6><B1C7><B1B6><B1C8><B0EA><B0C0><B0C1><B0A1><B0A2><B0BC><B1C9><B0C1>!<B0EE><B1C9><B0C1><B1B6><B1CA><B0EA><B0C0><B0C1>,<B1CB><B1A7><B1A8><B1CC><B0E7><B0F2><B1CD><B1CD>.<B1CE><B1C2><B0C2><B1CF><B1D0><B0EE><B0C0><B0C1><B0A1><B0A2><B0BC>!<B0B6><B0B7>,<B1D1><B0BA><B1D2><B1D3><B1CC><B0C5><B0BC><B1D4><B1D5>,<B1D6><B1D7><B1D8><B1D2><B1D9><B1DA>!",
      "french_v2_gloss": "PROF. CHEN :\nBien le bonjour !\nBienvenue !\nVoici le monde\nmagique\ndes Pokémon !\nMon nom est Chen,\nle Prof Pokémon !\nDes Pokémon\nvivent partout.\nCertains sont\nnos compagnons.\nD'autres les font\ncombattre.\nMoi, je les étudie.\nSacha !\nTa quête commence !\nRêves et aventures\nt'attendent !",
      "alignment_method": "unaligned",
